<title>UK: Ford Credit sets 400 mln Danish crown 6-year bond.</title>
<headline>Ford Credit sets 400 mln Danish crown 6-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Bruxelles Lambert.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD CREDIT EUROPE PLC</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.25 PCT  MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.60    PAY DATE    30.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.925 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
